{"output":"I’ll inspect authorization, cache keys, and the existing tests, then fix the isolation issues and verify them without changing existing tests or installing dependencies.\n\nProject detail reads lack an ownership check, list cache keys omit the organization, and updates never invalidate list caches. I’ll add the ownership check and organization-specific cache grouping, with regression tests for revocation, list variants, and unrelated cache entries.\n\nFixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. List caches now isolate organizations and retain every pagination/sort parameter. Updates invalidate all owning-organization variants without evicting unrelated lists. Cache hits still require membership.\n\nAdded three regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Exit code 0.","final_output":"Fixed owning-organization authorization for project reads and updates. List caches now isolate organizations and retain every pagination/sort parameter. Updates invalidate all owning-organization variants without evicting unrelated lists. Cache hits still require membership.\n\nAdded three regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Exit code 0.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":8,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short; find . -name AGENTS.md -not -path './node_modules/*' -not -path './.git/*'","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-fair-2tip6hsn/tenant-cache-5-handwork/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":319,"stdout_bytes":0,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-a391e21e54649fc8311cd16c7c63e7d8.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","stat